{"id":"839f229fc9fb3b6f","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-accessible-ordinal.md","title":"Accessible Ordinal","display":"df-accessible-ordinal — Accessible Ordinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-accessible-ordinal","aliases":["72-df-accessible-ordinal"],"display":"df-accessible-ordinal — Accessible Ordinal","depends_on":[],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §3.2.2; print270–271; PDF282–283","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-accessible-ordinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-accessible-ordinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-accessible-ordinal — Accessible Ordinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §3.2.2; print270–271; PDF282–283"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\">\\(O\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\\subseteq O^2\">\\(\\prec\\subseteq O^2\\)</span> 为任意关系；不预先假设它良基，也不预先假设它是序数表示。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in O\">\\(a\\in O\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下式是集合幂集上的正算子；所有与 X 有关的出现均为正。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec,\\mathrm{Accessible}_\\prec\">\\(\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec,\\mathrm{Accessible}_\\prec\\)</span> 由下式定义。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_\\prec(X):=\\{a\\in O:\\forall b\\in O\\ (b\\prec a\\to b\\in X)\\}\\quad(X\\subseteq O).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi_\\prec(X):=\\{a\\in O:\\forall b\\in O\\ (b\\prec a\\to b\\in X)\\}\\quad(X\\subseteq O).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec:=\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq O:\\Phi_\\prec(X)\\subseteq X\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Accessible}_\\prec(a)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ a\\in\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec:=\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq O:\\Phi_\\prec(X)\\subseteq X\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Accessible}_\\prec(a)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ a\\in\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是第 IV 章 §3.2.2 印刷 pp.270–271 / PDF pp.282–283 的可及部分算子。单调性直接来自前驱条件；所有前不动点族非空（O 在其中）。由最小前不动点论证，该交集是唯一最小不动点；不要求凭名称注册一个未定义的 μ 类算子。只有整个 O 都可及时才得到该关系的良基性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"O","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec\\subseteq O^2","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in O","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec,\\mathrm{Accessible}_\\prec","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_\\prec(X):=\\{a\\in O:\\forall b\\in O\\ (b\\prec a\\to b\\in X)\\}\\quad(X\\subseteq O).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec:=\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq O:\\Phi_\\prec(X)\\subseteq X\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Accessible}_\\prec(a)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ a\\in\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec.","display":true}],"bytes":1468,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-278","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-accessible-ordinal|df-accessible-ordinal — Accessible Ordinal]]"},{"id":"ce118b25d2b12cdc","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(O,\\prec)$ 与 $\\Phi_\\prec,\\mathrm{Acc}_\\prec$ 取 [[72-df-accessible-ordinal]]；$\\mathrm{WF}$ 取 [[72-df-transfinite-induction]]；$\\operatorname{Down}$ 在下式局部定义。"},{"id":"6b40e3ecfaa895b6","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(D_\\varepsilon,R_\\varepsilon)$ 如 [[72-df-epsilon-0-notation]]，$\\mathrm{Acc}_R$ 为 [[72-df-accessible-ordinal]] 的最小前驱闭包。"}],"outgoing":[]}